# Claude agent state — runtime only, never tracked.
# Exceptions tracked in repo:
#   .claude/agents/         — project-level sub-agent definitions
#   .claude/review-context/ — PR-review-bot playbooks (see .github/workflows/claude-pr-review.yml)
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/review-context/
